    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dee719f5a372041504d705",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──那么今天，\n要为愿意停下脚步的各位献唱新曲呗！\n请听这首，“蓝靛果色的梦”♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f6a0dfe23d8f77522f3e1cb2037f4a14e89496c72504441a5a4dd6dfd5fed5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
