    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8443a2d1b36baef862cc29bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "车站前的在地偶像“晨间活动”结束后，\n我们两人来到附近的餐厅，\n准备吃一顿稍迟的早餐──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39b5c83c12c502fcc7a6165f49f61ad28b2c7b5208b8a74a98047645c42dac7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
