    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec97ca3ce52a3428ccf6f342",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──太棒了！今天早上无论是手册发放率、\n还是社交平台的追踪者增加数，\n都前所未有地高呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9524bd3b004a85cfaf9d6aa80051d04d8a0667881b96d513aeb35fed962a46c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
