    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8375063afc663b0a6afe6e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。努力增加新曲、\n开设宣传账号、\n强调自己是即将出道的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad28f5230d2b5801c8bbf6a487ca822cc1e095599ff4b7fdfcd1146a5f31a41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
