    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa85c15abf581b6852ef092d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不好意思，又让你费心帮忙了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68aac761dbe8b1f6ee104983ba33880bc4581df0d859fb84088224bd607b588d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e902026131f8c7788c5eef4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，北港火山有个梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee06373511c4017047abebeb46a4be71811475baf2b0cc0598f920519d9f47a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b4325f5c85115e3a18556e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──那就是将自己出生长大的故乡，\n北海道的“苫小牧”推广至全国，\n让故乡繁荣起来的伟大梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b5980595e367db3342b8b2d9d154acc5ff2a3d1a51a0c710341b4fbda6c9176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40af63a798c971c11a101f3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在闪耀系列赛中崭露头角，\n以苫小牧地在偶像身份吸引目光──\n两者都是她达成梦想的必经之路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccac144500a5ebeac16378c0fa59e2c660d2e2e2bd27f1605f7b55abd7c2431e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:395555fd8af2452e6f6110cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee1a88f99b1a696d33193182032b690b1f067c59c49543607bd7a836e26d514",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb20a0133a3304bde70361c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──是仅仅陪在身旁就能感受到温情的人，\n脸上温柔的表情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10117603f31617d01354445e12de033078c836b03859e2c0407695c315b7dcc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9037404795777b893c6812c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此我决定了，\n无论是竞赛还是在地偶像的活动，\n我都要以训练员的身份支持北港火山。",
